1. When dealing cards, check if the player or dealer is dealt an ace. If so, set the value of the ace to 11.
2. After checking the total value of the player or dealer's hand, check if they have any aces. If the total is greater than 21 and the player or dealer has an ace, set the value of the ace to 1 instead of 11.

